&lt;li&gt;Stay at the forefront of AV technology advancements, continuously learning about new products, solutions, and industry trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some travel may be required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
