&lt;li&gt;2–3 years of experience supporting AV systems and live events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UCC Platforms such as Zoom, Google Meet, and Streaming platforms such as Riverside and Goldcast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video production switchers and digital audio consoles&lt;/li&gt;
