&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Engineering Manager to join the Cloud Browser Isolation Product Team. This role is based in Bangalore with a hybrid work model, reporting to the Director, Software Engineering. You will lead the Cloud Browser Isolation team within an engineering organization that built the world’s largest cloud security platform. Bringing your vision and passion to our team of experts, you will enable organizations worldwide to harness speed and agility with a cloud-first strategy while managing the delivery of highly scalable security services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor a team of 8-10 software engineers while managing performance and personal career progression plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive critical product and roadmap initiatives for the Cloud Browser Isolation team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high-quality outputs across the entire lifecycle, from initial feature development to long-term system reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee capacity planning and resource allocation to ensure predictable and efficient delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical leader ensuring the team’s contributions align with our global multitenant architecture goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional experience in software development and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience building, leading, managing, and mentoring high-performance engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with Chromium&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical proficiency with C++, Kubernetes, and Distributed Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to formulate data-driven and business-driven engineering decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking ownership and getting high-quality results in a predictable fashion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-GL2 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
