&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-503 citation-end-503&quot;&gt;About the team + role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-55&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-501 citation-502&quot;&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world&#39;s biggest &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-500 citation-501 citation-502 citation-end-502&quot;&gt;financial problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-500 citation-501 citation-end-501&quot;&gt; We&#39;re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-500 citation-end-500&quot;&gt;t. Robinhood isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it&#39;s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers! &lt;/span&gt;Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-56&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Concierge Team&lt;/strong&gt; is dedicated to building white-glove, seamless, and premium mobile experiences that support and delight our customers. &lt;span class=&quot;citation-499 citation-end-499&quot;&gt;As an iOS Engineer on this team, you will take high-level ownership of the user-facing mobile experience, crafting elegant interfaces and robust client-side architectures using Swift and modern iOS frameworks.&lt;/span&gt; You will work closely with product managers, designers, backend engineering partners, and data teams to deliver highly personalized features that make navigating financial landscapes intuitive and empowering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-57&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-498&quot;&gt;This role is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-496 citation-497 citation-498&quot;&gt;based in our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-496 citation-497 citation-498&quot;&gt;Menlo Park, CA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-496 citation-497 citation-498 citation-end-498&quot;&gt; office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-496 citation-497 citation-end-497&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-496 citation-497 citation-end-497&quot;&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-496 citation-end-496&quot;&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-495 citation-end-495&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-58&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-493 citation-end-493&quot;&gt;Develop smooth, stable, and highly responsive customer-facing features within the Robinhood iOS ecosystem using Swift and modern APIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-59&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-492 citation-end-492&quot;&gt;Define and implement scalable mobile architecture patterns that balance short-term product delivery with long-term code maintainability and system health.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-60&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-491 citation-end-491&quot;&gt;Partner with Product Designers, Product Managers, and Backend Software Engineers to take features from inception and technical design through to launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-61&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-490 citation-end-490&quot;&gt;Drive application performance, observability, testing coverage, and release stability across core Concierge features.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-62&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-489 citation-end-489&quot;&gt;Provide constructive feedback during code reviews, contribute to technical documentation, and mentor peer engineers to strengthen our tight-knit iOS community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;3+ years of professional software development experience specializing in iOS development, with a track record of shipping high-quality production apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-63&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-488 citation-end-488&quot;&gt;Strong expertise with Swift, UIKit, and a solid understanding of modern iOS architecture patterns and memory management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-63&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-487 citation-end-487&quot;&gt;A strong product sense and passion for building intuitive user experiences, with the ability to translate design mockups into pixel-perfect, accessible mobile interfaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-63&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-486 citation-end-486&quot;&gt;Experience writing clean, testable code and a commitment to maintaining high standards through robust testing, profiling, and debugging.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_a6d669a1c308ff5f-63&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-485 citation-end-485&quot;&gt;Clear, effective communication skills and a collaborative approach to solving complex technical problems across engineering boundaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;c1a2o7&quot; data-start=&quot;3642&quot; data-end=&quot;3693&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10nzurp&quot; data-start=&quot;3694&quot; data-end=&quot;3819&quot;&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hq13xo&quot; data-start=&quot;3820&quot; data-end=&quot;3947&quot;&gt;Best in class benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;117nnrx&quot; data-start=&quot;3948&quot; data-end=&quot;4045&quot;&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p0jp9i&quot; data-start=&quot;4046&quot; data-end=&quot;4137&quot;&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;z2b7ur&quot; data-start=&quot;4138&quot; data-end=&quot;4240&quot;&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;179zx0w&quot; data-start=&quot;4241&quot; data-end=&quot;4328&quot;&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 (Menlo Park, CA; New York, NY; Bellevue, WA; Washington, DC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$166,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$147,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$172,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 3 (Lake Mary, FL; Clearwater, FL; Gainesville, FL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$152,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

