&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Securing the Future with AvePoint&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;AvePoint is a global leader in data management and governance, trusted by over 21,000 customers worldwide to enhance their digital workplaces across Microsoft, Google, Salesforce, and other collaboration platforms. Our global channel partner program includes more than 3,500 managed service providers, value-added resellers, and systems integrators, with our solutions featured in over 100 cloud marketplaces. To learn more, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.avepoint.com&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot;&gt;www.avepoint.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At AvePoint, we are dedicated to investing in our people. Our culture, driven by agility, passion, and teamwork, empowers you to shape your career, make a significant impact, and take ownership of your future. Discover how you can unleash your potential with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW14579058 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-SG&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW14579058 BCX0&quot;&gt;Scope of Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW14579058 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-SG&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW14579058 BCX0&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To be involved in Proof-Of-Concept solutioning for new technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Overall Technical Lead for the product and all deployment tasks related to the product.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To be System administrator for development related tools in the sandbox environment on Salesforce and Mulesoft.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide Salesforce/MuleSoft/AWS expertise and guidance during technical solutioning discussions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide advice when required for enhancements related to product suite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support onboarding of new features and enhancements on the product suite’s new versions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Liaise with product team to gather requirements and translate to technical solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Oversee the reduction of technical debt and set code reviews standards to ensure the code quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Pair-program with our technical team to level up their skillset and domain knowledge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To be involved in discussion and solutioning for integration with other Applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To provide technical expertise view on technical issues for developmental and operation maintenance of product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Review release notes for each of Salesforce major release to assess any impact to the System&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with the team to manage technical risks and ensure compliance to government’s security policies and adherence to secure coding standards and best practices, including data modelling, data sharing, and data privacy&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259589045 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-SG&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259589045 BCX0&quot;&gt;Work Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW259589045 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[1004],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shall have at least a Diploma, with at least Five (5) years’ of IT Solution Architect cum Technical Lead experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in supporting Government Projects will be an added advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in multiple types of Salesforce clouds (Sales, Service and etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with Agile development methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW190608299 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-SG&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW190608299 BCX0&quot;&gt;Technical skillset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shall have knowledge and experience in Salesforce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Relevant experience in Mulesoft, AWS, Odaseva, APEX coding and DevOps will be an advantage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Certification in Salesforce Certified Platform Developer I, Salesforce Certified Platform Developer II and Salesforce Integration Architect will be strongly preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Certification in Platform App Builder, Mulesoft Developer I, Mulesoft Developer II, Mulesoft Architect certification will be an added advantage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in SHIP-HATS platform, example, using GitLab for version control and deployment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in Project Management tool such as JIRA and Confluence will be an added advantage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW171007156 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-SG&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW171007156 BCX0&quot;&gt;General Skillset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1440,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,4],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills in stakeholders’ engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1440,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,4],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1440,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,4],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Ability to create and maintain clear and comprehensive technical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1440,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,4],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong leadership and ability to manage technical tasks and software development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AvePoint is proud to employ talent from many different backgrounds, experiences, and identities. We believe that diversity and inclusion drives our success and is at the core of how we hire, communicate, and collaborate to deliver value and excellence. We are committed to fostering an environment where people can bring their whole selves to work and feel a sense of belonging, and we continue to work toward creating a workforce that represents the diversity of our customers and communities. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Any personal data you share with us during the application process will be processed strictly in compliance with applicable data protection laws and our &lt;a id=&quot;menur12n&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.avepoint.com/company/privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

